          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Luclin Ubermob Mangles guild!</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=33','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Kayel </font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 12/6/2001 2:19:15 PM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>Yep, our first forays into Luclin have been interesting.  Little were we expecting to find a new Uberbeast ready to chew us up like batwing crunchies!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Well, SoL is out as we're all aware.  I must say that the graphics and the new textures are making the game interesting again - plus the naked pictures of Mckenna that Bhhaal took will be posted shortly.  That's the BEST EQ bug I've ever seen.<br><br>However, in our explorations of Norrath I must admit we've found a new critter to fight against - LAG!<br><br>Those of us that are running Luclin are facing zone times of several minutes, graphics problems, inability to cast spells and other issues.  <br><br>Currently this has grounded our typical raiding - half our guild can't get online and the other half can't do anything when they are online.  :(<br><br>Some suggestions to fix problems:<br><br>1.  Defrag your Harddrive.  SoL is HD intensive and having your drive defragged can only help load times.<br><br>2.  Unload programs in background memory.  This means ICQ, various drivers for Cd burners/Mice/Video cards leave accessories open.  Unload Ms-Office Quickstart, etc.  The only thing I'm leaving up is my firewall.<br><br>3.  Select only those new graphics you want to us.  Pick the cute ones and set the trolls back to the old graphics.  ;)<br><br>Hopefully when more than 25% of our guild can get back online we'll go cause some more havoc - but it was hardly the loot filled launch we wanted.  :(                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               </font>
</td>
